From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jrash <johnrash@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:07:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 004/342] arm64: add Amlogic Meson GX debug UART

Debug UART for "amlogic,meson-gx-uart" (S905 uart_AO on the ODROID-C2),
used by the EFI loader after ExitBootServices and by the kernel debug
console. Polled FIFO access only; baud rate and pins stay as the firmware
set them up.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
